money on four quiet pillars: cushion, autopilot, boring, and patience.\n\nCushion: three months of bills, untouched. Autopilot: savings leave on payday. Boring: broad, dull funds, no hot tips. Patience: let the years work.\n\nTogether, money finally got quiet. I check it once a month and sleep just fine.\n\nSo I put all four on one page, and it beat every course I almost bought. No secret made me calm. Boring habits did.",quality:"1080p",duration_seconds:50.084},$R[1210]={id:"6850c551-da96-4a99-b317-20002e5add29",slug:"new-27-10-4-starting-a-clothing-brand",source:"higgsfield",title:"Starting a Clothing Brand",description:"An honest clothing brand startup story with bold captions and graphic overlays.",category:"style-transfer",thumbnail_media:$R[1211]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/f018fb2f-5368-4f14-bd4b-21155684ec40.jpg"},video_media:$R[1212]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/7c1ee4f3-e5af-4a27-a8a1-dd8ef7bede4a.mp4",compressed_url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/bfec5d2c-235b-4174-9bd2-034130217c62.mp4",width:720,height:1280,media_id:"8f53ee03-8ce3-45ab-9802-140f409e0daf",duration_seconds:null,thumbnail_url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/fe10e837-e223-4178-9baf-2a1d76a82799.webp"},character_media:$R[1213]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/433c6050-35f7-4cdf-b71b-8039e3a96095.png",width:2048,height:1152},generated_video_media:$R[1214]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/1c1caa5e-cee3-488e-b328-9c276efb8d6b.mp4",compressed_url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/aad4cd21-791d-4ec7-8f86-f64d34de535f.mp4",width:1080,height:1920,media_id:"5cbdb8b6-2c47-41c4-8eef-b4fd297ccf4c",duration_seconds:null,thumbnail_url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/d1b52b79-b9f9-445f-be0e-819f05f73d5e.webp"},views:202877,likes:7031,comments:88,recreates:595,so