tructions:void 0,own_videos:$R[1251]=[],script:"Two pictures made from pieces. And the whole difference is what happens to the light. Look at this stone mosaic. Every piece is set flat. So daylight bounces off its surface and back at your eyes. Up close, it's all edges. Step back and it becomes one picture on a surface.\n\nMosaics reflect. Now the window. Same pieces, opposite direction. Light passes through the colored glass and the dark lead lines hold the shapes together. And the colors don't stay in the glass. Daylight carries them into the room across the floor and they change as the day moves.\n\nThat's transmitted light, light passing through and taking the picture with it. One keeps the image on a surface. The other lets it become part of the room you're standing in. Honestly, I'd stay in front of the window longer. The picture keeps changing with the light.",quality:"1080p",duration_seconds:51.625651},$R[1252]={id:"b2648193-71ad-450f-a6e6-ce0b45073704",slug:"new-27-10-3-your-first-tattoo",source:"higgsfield",title:"Your First Tattoo",description:"A tattoo studio story about quality, trust, and choosing the right artist.",category:"style-transfer",thumbnail_media:$R[1253]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/4f27a1ba-12ca-41c8-b90f-515ab148e9a2.jpg"},video_media:$R[1254]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/c17b72a7-b514-4fc7-884d-db8ce6309ec1.mp4",compressed_url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/df98f9b3-6ac0-4b38-b5ca-c2f0edacabe8.mp4",width:720,height:1280,media_id:"d05b272d-baeb-4a15-ad1e-a01c0f7ff0a3",duration_seconds:null,thumbnail_url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/90cdfae7-86ba-46bb-bb42-293aae8f028f.webp"},character_media:$R[1255]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-reels-presets/8f0355b6-c6a7-43fe-b67e-8794469760ed.png",width:2048,height:1152},generated_video_media:$R[1256]={url:"https://static-public-media.higgsfield.ai/ai-